{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":15,"created_at":"2025-03-17T07:41:42Z","updated_at":"2025-04-08T18:41:59Z","closed_at":"2025-04-08T17:46:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104264","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-08T17:46:51Z"},"body":"While inspecting memory layout of `Node`, I notice that it has a lot of gdvirtual functions generated by `GDVIRTUAL*` macros with suboptimal layout. It has a `bool` flag in the middle with 7 bytes padding. `Node` has 10 gdvirtual methods, so the total padding size is 70 bytes, contributing 6.5% to the size of `Node`. I think it should be good to eliminate this waste.\r\n\r\nThe idea is, a gdvirtual function currently has 3 state:\r\n- pre-initialized: `initialized == false`, `ptr == nullptr`\r\n- initialized: `initialized == true`, `ptr != nullptr`\r\n- invalid: `initialized == true`, `ptr == nullptr`\r\n\r\nWe can represent them with one single pointer with an invalid pointer value (I choose `(uintptr_t)-1` here):\r\n- pre-initialized: `ptr == nullptr`\r\n- initialized: `ptr != nullptr && ptr != (void *)(uintptr_t)-1`\r\n- invalid: `ptr == (void *)(uintptr_t)-1`\r\n\r\nI ran some quick regression test to ensure gdvirtual call performance is not affected.\r\nTest project: [test_virtual_call.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19281191/test_virtual_call.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264/reactions","total_count":20,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":6,"eyes":8},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104264/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}